This is an unofficial plugin for MicroStation created by Orven Fajardo. It is
not an official Bentley Systems plugin, product, or support offering. Bentley
Systems does not maintain or endorse this project.

The installer can enable `IFC_ALLOW_DEPRECATED_SCHEMA=1` as documented by
Bentley KB0098741. This compatibility setting is optional. It broadens accepted
IFC input and should be used only with trusted legacy files.

`data/catalogue.json` is a derived interoperability catalogue built from the
public IFC+SG resources identified in its metadata. Those source materials
remain subject to the terms and rights of their respective publishers. The
catalogue is provided for pre-flight validation and does not replace official
CORENET X material.
